-- PEQ content gaps vs peq-dump (2026-10-26).
-- Manual apply only (utils/sql/git/optional). Not in database:updates.
--
-- Includes:
--   1) Historical Wizard Epic 1.0 loot (Mistletoe Powder / Cazic's Skin)
--   2) Heading rescale rows still at 0-256 / old values (filtered from
--      2022_09_03_fix_*_heading*.sql). Rows peq already moved are skipped.
--
-- Does NOT include: misty/neriak PoK stones, sseru/mischief doors, pot lockpick,
-- PoK spell vendors (already in dump), or diverged heading rows.

-- ========== 1. Epic loot restore ==========
-- Restore historical Epic 1.0 loot missing from the peq dump.
--
-- Mistletoe Powder (14333) → Tolapumj (npc 89000, loottable 360) in Old Sebilis.
-- Cazic's Skin (14332) → Cazic Thule (npc 72003, loottable 291) in Plane of Fear.
--
-- These were the original Wizard Epic 1.0 components before the Enraged Golem /
-- Green Oil path. Kandin Firepot still accepts the older hand-in.
--
-- Perfect Acrylia Ore (9052) already has lootdrop rows on the Grey trap NPCs
-- (a stone beast, a boulder fiend, Stonehand, Boulder). Those NPCs have no
-- spawn2 rows by design — they spawn from thegrey/a_creature.pl proximity traps.
-- No SQL change for 9052.
--
-- Spear of Fate: the live script emeraldjungle/Spirit_Sentinel_.lua rewards
-- item 10651. Item 36223 is a legacy duplicate accepted by Elder Spirit of
-- Enlightenment. Do not add a loot row for 36223.

-- Mistletoe Powder on Tolapumj
